                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "3491040d-a879-4568-ab97-daad6c032560",
                        "entry_id": "85567794-4343-398f-8672-ba034f650692",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more dizzied"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "baec3570-46c4-46ff-88d3-198b6838edc7",
                        "entry_id": "85567794-4343-398f-8672-ba034f650692",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most dizzied"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9e82d4b9-e504-3290-b4b1-26063f5f040d",
                        "entry_id": "85567794-4343-398f-8672-ba034f650692",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Dizzy; light-headed."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7190669c-0583-4d75-9a20-30bd9ed07816",
                                "sense_id": "9e82d4b9-e504-3290-b4b1-26063f5f040d",
                                "text": "When he reached the landing he was very dizzied and walked over to a corner where he made himself comfortable for the time being."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c5e6420f-5464-4f06-ad61-49c35084aeff",
                                "sense_id": "9e82d4b9-e504-3290-b4b1-26063f5f040d",
                                "text": "She was even more dizzied to realize there was true hunger in his voice and that the hunger was for her."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c719afa0-1cca-4c4c-a2c8-70ef7a5c4d88",
                                "sense_id": "9e82d4b9-e504-3290-b4b1-26063f5f040d",
                                "text": "I could do no more than rise to hands and knees and then collapse, eyes shut against the spinning of my dizzied head, my back agaist the beast-wagon that had shielded me from certain death."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "15895165-a3e9-36af-8cce-d9a34afd4bef",
                        "entry_id": "85567794-4343-398f-8672-ba034f650692",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Frenzied; frenetic."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2588f779-bd2f-48d6-b788-23cc3290b850",
                                "sense_id": "15895165-a3e9-36af-8cce-d9a34afd4bef",
                                "text": "Then comes heart-ached, care, distress, Blighted hope, and loneliness, Wounds from friend, and gifts from foe, Dizzied faith, and guilt and woe,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "755c279a-13b0-4c39-bdd8-6a0b65d00e38",
                                "sense_id": "15895165-a3e9-36af-8cce-d9a34afd4bef",
                                "text": "Those taps reached the Square and still further, when the few lanterns were lit and the bats began their dizzied chase and the silence could no longer fit in pockets and words had a hard time huddling on the lips of all the persons spared by the War, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7595f33c-8725-4dff-a448-ddfd90212ad3",
                                "sense_id": "15895165-a3e9-36af-8cce-d9a34afd4bef",
                                "text": "With the short notice to leave Nuwara Eliya, Bill and I plunged into dizzied activity."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
